    <meta name='description' content='Dynasty hypersphere, Rothschild: the pocket world, to be Inlined in a host (it EXPORTs its shots, Probe, sensors and shaders). Radius = time: 1725 at the core, 2026 at the glass, 313.5 years per pocket unit, shells every 50 years. Azimuth: houses west to east, angle = 2 + people. Elevation: order of descent (layout only). Generated by build_hypersphere.py 1.2 from loom-view.json; do not edit.'/>
